                                                                <div class="ugov-of-pd-year-rules-2"><div>6 - Open choice courses: the student must acquire 12 ECTS by selecting any of the courses offered by the University of Milan or by the Grenoble-Alpes University, provided that they are in English, and coherent with Plant Science topics and that the course content does not overlap with those present in mandatory and guided-choice courses. Obviously, as open choice courses, the student can pick the remaining guided-choice courses that he/she had not inserted in the study plan.</div>
