              <div id="curr-20270000fbjof2-FBJ-0-p" class="panel-collapse collapse">
                <div class="panel-body">
                                      <div id="prop-cds-content" class="ugov-of-pd-rules-p-af-text">There are no propaedeutic courses in Plant Science that can limit progression from the first to the second year. First-year students must acquire 60 ECTS by September 30th in order to be admitted to the second year.</div>
